Subject: [PATCH] misc: mediatek: implement MT6897 SCP sensor transport

Implement bounded MT6897 SCP mailbox transport and the sensor-hub
handshake, expose accelerometer/light/gyro/magnetometer through IIO and
provide the modem lifecycle callback interface.

